observable breadcrumbs, while generatedruntime
converges through GetSensitiveType lifecycle
reads.
The retained resource-local builders preserve
SENSITIVE_TYPE and SENSITIVE_CATEGORY
polymorphic request bodies.
Mutable fields follow the reviewed
UpdateSensitiveType subtype surfaces.
ChangeSensitiveTypeCompartment and cross-subtype
mutation remain outside the published runtime.
Delete retains the finalizer through DELETING
until DELETED or NotFound. There are no Secret
